  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Engagement Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CEA Boost programme aims to further institutionalize Community Engagement and Accountability (CEA) within the RCRC Movement. With the eventual goal of improving RCRC response. Particular attention is paid to feedback mechanisms. In five countries NSs are directly supported: Ivory Coast, Mali, South Sudan, Sudan and Zambia. In addition, the IFRC is strengthened through contributions for trainings, positions and research.</narrative>
  </description>
